🐘  LARAVEL BACKEND (backend-laravel/)

   Prasyarat: PHP 8.1+, Composer, MySQL/PostgreSQL

   Cara menjalankan:
   ────────────────────────────────────────────────
   cd backend-laravel
   composer install
   cp .env.example .env          # Konfigurasi database
   php artisan key:generate
   php artisan migrate            # Buat tabel database
   php artisan serve              # http://localhost:8000
   ────────────────────────────────────────────────

   Struktur:
   ├── routes/api.php             Semua endpoint API
   ├── app/Models/                Transaction, Receipt, Goal, Budget
   ├── app/Http/Controllers/Api/  Transaction, Insight, Receipt
   └── database/migrations/       SQL migration files

   Fitur:
   - Full REST API (mirror Python endpoints)
   - Eloquent ORM untuk database
   - Migration system untuk schema management
   - Sanctum untuk API authentication
   - Siap di-deploy ke Laravel Forge / Vapor

============================================================

🗄️  DATABASE SQL (MySQL / PostgreSQL)

   Backend Python mendukung 3 database:
   ┌──────────┬──────────────┬─────────────────────────────┐
   │ Database │ File Config   │ Cara Install Driver         │
   ├──────────┼──────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
   │ SQLite   │ db_config.py │ Built-in (default)          │
   │ MySQL    │ db_mysql.py  │ pip install pymysql          │
   │ Postgres │ db_postgres  │ pip install psycopg2-binary │
   └──────────┴──────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘

   Cara mengganti database:
   1. Buka .env
   2. Set DB_TYPE=mysql atau DB_TYPE=postgresql
   3. Isi credentials database
   4. Jalankan: python -c "from db_mysql import init_mysql_db; init_mysql_db()"

